        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your maid start living together after you lose your parents in a robbery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the maid becomes overprotective of you after the incident, and you find yourself becoming more and more “Yandere” in this slightly horrifying exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/dfaa747e482261f0378c0d0c0af34e01.poster.avif?t=1764324189\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/dfaa747e482261f0378c0d0c0af34e01.webm?t=1764324189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing your parents to a robbery, you moved with your maid. The new house had numerous problems due to the recent move, and you scrambled to fix them. However, the maid gradually became overprotective of you, increasingly restricting your actions. Escape the maid, solve puzzles and mysteries, and discover the shocking truth about the maid...?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/1c40c36f2da4125dd9e356c3f6299568.poster.avif?t=1764324189\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/1c40c36f2da4125dd9e356c3f6299568.webm?t=1764324189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for items to clear the game. Solve puzzles and riddles to obtain keys, fuses, and other items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/4aa8a5bf9fb465be98de2ef0b2aabf19.avif?t=1764324189\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras_big/4aa8a5bf9fb465be98de2ef0b2aabf19.webp?t=1764324189 width=1560 height=292 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for newspapers and notes. They may hold clues to solving puzzles and mysteries. Could they contain information that reveals the maid's true nature?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/4bc5f628fa6ac1b848cc0457ddbad404.poster.avif?t=1764324189\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/4bc5f628fa6ac1b848cc0457ddbad404.webm?t=1764324189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, the maid becomes increasingly overprotective of you, gradually developing yandere tendencies. What exactly is her purpose? Can you evade the pursuing maid and uncover the shocking truth hidden within her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a first-person perspective with WASD controls using keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and commentary are permitted.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your maid start living together after you lose your parents in a robbery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the maid becomes overprotective of you after the incident, and you find yourself becoming more and more “Yandere” in this slightly horrifying exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/dfaa747e482261f0378c0d0c0af34e01.poster.avif?t=1764324189\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/dfaa747e482261f0378c0d0c0af34e01.webm?t=1764324189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing your parents to a robbery, you moved with your maid. The new house had numerous problems due to the recent move, and you scrambled to fix them. However, the maid gradually became overprotective of you, increasingly restricting your actions. Escape the maid, solve puzzles and mysteries, and discover the shocking truth about the maid...?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/1c40c36f2da4125dd9e356c3f6299568.poster.avif?t=1764324189\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/1c40c36f2da4125dd9e356c3f6299568.webm?t=1764324189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for items to clear the game. Solve puzzles and riddles to obtain keys, fuses, and other items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/4aa8a5bf9fb465be98de2ef0b2aabf19.avif?t=1764324189\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras_big/4aa8a5bf9fb465be98de2ef0b2aabf19.webp?t=1764324189 width=1560 height=292 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for newspapers and notes. They may hold clues to solving puzzles and mysteries. Could they contain information that reveals the maid's true nature?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/4bc5f628fa6ac1b848cc0457ddbad404.poster.avif?t=1764324189\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/extras/4bc5f628fa6ac1b848cc0457ddbad404.webm?t=1764324189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, the maid becomes increasingly overprotective of you, gradually developing yandere tendencies. What exactly is her purpose? Can you evade the pursuing maid and uncover the shocking truth hidden within her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a first-person perspective with WASD controls using keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and commentary are permitted.</p>",
